# "Flash" from hand: Bot1 casts the Borrower in Bot2's declare attackers step on turn 4, after Elvish Mystic and
# Ornithopter attack. "Can block only creatures with flying": the Borrower may not block the Mystic (refusal) but may
# block the Ornithopter (the positive control, 3 damage kills it). The Mystic's damage goes through.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Brazen Borrower
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Ornithopter
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Elvish Mystic; Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Brazen Borrower.Cast
! Bot1.Block(Brazen Borrower > Elvish Mystic)
Bot1.Block(Brazen Borrower > Ornithopter)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Brazen Borrower
